# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# The copy round-trip in tools/ locates edits by exact byte anchors that contain
# newlines, so a checkout that rewrites LF to CRLF silently breaks every anchor.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webp binary
